error of each row: \eqn{\epsilon_{ij} \sim N(0, \sigma_w^2 + se_{ij}^2)}.
The species means are then weighted by \eqn{1/(\sigma_w^2 + se_{ij}^2)},
and the likelihood stays exact and linear in the number of rows.
